<title>UK: CSFB sets call warrants on Alusuisse shares.</title>
<headline>CSFB sets call warrants on Alusuisse shares.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Suisse First Boston Zurich said it has issued three million American-style call warrants on registered shares of Alusuisse.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 20 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1,225 CHF		 PREMIUM	8.9 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     4.38 CHF		  GEARING	13.8 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 25.FEB.97-10.DEC.97   PAYDATE	24.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS		     MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  1,205 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
